# Environment / secrets — NEVER commit these
.env

# Raw PDFs — often large; download them yourself from AWS docs
data/raw/*.pdf

# NOTE: data/processed/ is intentionally NOT excluded.
# The Chroma DB and BM25 index must be committed so the HF Spaces deployment
# has a pre-built index. Recruiters testing the live demo won't run build_index.py.
# This is the opposite of the usual advice — it's a deliberate tradeoff for a demo.

